# Git worktrees of this repo. Each is a full checkout, so every project in one
# collides with the project it was checked out from and Nx refuses to build a
# graph at all — `nx run fe-01:test` exits 1 before running anything. `git`
# ignores them through `.git/info/exclude`, which Nx does not read.
.worktrees
